   "is_free": true,
   "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/a540542c9e4e836390bfb24a25c205bf.poster.avif?t=1786493086\" width=700 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/a540542c9e4e836390bfb24a25c205bf.webm?t=1786493086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/a540542c9e4e836390bfb24a25c205bf.mp4?t=1786493086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/94748cbaeec0ad3090ce509567b709e9.poster.avif?t=1786493086\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/94748cbaeec0ad3090ce509567b709e9.webm?t=1786493086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/94748cbaeec0ad3090ce509567b709e9.mp4?t=1786493086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>落地，</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >跳傘進入<strong>不斷擴展與變化</strong>的地圖，挑戰生存極限！你會選擇<strong>安全但物資稀少</strong>的野外區域，還是<strong>直接跳入擁擠的城市，從落地就開始激戰</strong>？<strong>每一次跳傘都是全新挑戰</strong>，如何利用手中的物資存活，全憑你的選擇！ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/4bb643362d2925a1950009742966fba0.poster.avif?t=1786493086\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/4bb643362d2925a1950009742966fba0.webm?t=1786493086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/4bb643362d2925a1950009742966fba0.mp4?t=1786493086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>搜刮，</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >使用獨特武器、多樣物資和特殊工具智取對手！為你的愛槍<strong>配備強力配件</strong>，或冒險爭奪<strong>競爭激烈的空投補給箱</strong>，搶奪強大戰利品，掌握戰場優勢！ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/960d991a398e5ab7472f6e7677693968.poster.avif?t=1786493086\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/960d991a398e5ab7472f6e7677693968.webm?t=1786493086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/960d991a398e5ab7472f6e7677693968.mp4?t=1786493086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>生存</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >搜刮物資只是生存的開始！隨著安全區不斷縮小，與其他生存者正面交鋒的風險將大幅提升。死亡即淘汰！若想成為最後的倖存者並奪得最終勝利，你必須<strong>更聰明、更快速，或是槍法更凌厲</strong>！ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/fa735ab8c6a53aad70db16bca96549d9.poster.avif?t=1786493086\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/fa735ab8c6a53aad70db16bca96549d9.webm?t=1786493086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/fa735ab8c6a53aad70db16bca96549d9.mp4?t=1786493086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>多種遊玩方式，</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在團隊殊死戰中暖身、體驗<strong>街機模式</strong>中不斷變化的玩法、跳入最新的季節活動、或<strong>打造自己的自訂大廳</strong>，與好友展開獨一無二的挑戰！ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/83ece2f7635b618bee2c6dd899a13503.poster.avif?t=1786493086\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/83ece2f7635b618bee2c6dd899a13503.webm?t=1786493086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/83ece2f7635b618bee2c6dd899a13503.mp4?t=1786493086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>每場對戰都獨一無二</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>每場戰鬥都是獨一無二，生存全憑你的決策！</strong> 跳入絕地戰場，每一步、每個抉擇都將決定勝負，奮戰到底，成為最後的倖存者！ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >遊戲內商品可自由選擇購買。 </p>",
